# Build output. Everything is derived, except the two artifacts the demo page
# loads at runtime: the WASM verifier and the contract ABI. Those are committed
# deliberately so the hosted demo works from a bare clone, without a Fe toolchain.
out/*
!out/feguard.wasm
!out/FairDice.abi.json
!out/FairDice.bin
*.exe
*.tar.gz
reports/cohort*-evidence.json
reports/cohort-expanded*
